              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "lutzflcat"
            },
            "reviewBody": "The olives and their brine are the stars in this, although I will add a few more olives next time. That little bit of sour cream also helps the spreading consistency. Quick, easy, and good.",
            "datePublished": "2024-09-11T20:08:28.839Z"
