            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "LovesCooking"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Your guests will compete with each other over who gets the last stuffed celery. It’s that good. The filling is so rich but also very balanced that it never gets overwhelming. The richness of the cream cheese is nicely balanced with the brininess of the olives and the crunchiness of the walnuts. You can also use the filling on so many things like toast, chips etc",
